  <div class="sec-sub">PerformanceMonitor + EvalDecorator를 1줄로 시작하는 고수준 Facade. 단축 데코레이터 11개 + 팩토리 메서드 4개 제공.</div>
  <div class="cls-card">
    <div class="cls-head"><span class="cls-name">QuickEval</span><span class="kind cls">class</span><span class="cls-src">agent_evaluator.quick_eval</span></div>
    <div class="cls-body">
      <div class="slbl">생성자 파라미터</div>
      {% call param_table() %}
          <tr><td><span class="p">output_dir</span><span class="req">✦</span></td><td><span class="t">str</span></td><td>—</td><td>JSON/HTML 리포트 저장 디렉토리</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">auto_save</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">bool</span></td><td><code>False</code></td><td>N건마다 save_to_file() 자동 호출</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">auto_save_interval</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">int</span></td><td><code>10</code></td><td>자동 저장 주기</td></tr>
      {% endcall %}
      <div class="slbl">단축 데코레이터 (11개)</div>
      <div class="note tip" style="margin-bottom:8px">💡 모두 <code>@eval.단축키</code> 형식이며 내부적으로 <code>@agent_eval</code>을 사용합니다.</div>
      <table class="mtable">
        <thead><tr><th>단축키</th><th>task_type</th><th>비고</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><span class="p">@eval.qa</span></td><td><code>"qa"</code></td><td>질의응답</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">@eval.tool_use</span></td><td><code>"tool_use"</code></td><td>도구 호출</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">@eval.rag</span></td><td><code>"information_retrieval"</code></td><td>hallucination_detection 자동 활성</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">@eval.code</span></td><td><code>"code_generation"</code></td><td>AST 비교 정확도</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">@eval.reasoning</span></td><td><code>"reasoning"</code></td><td></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">@eval.planning</span></td><td><code>"planning"</code></td><td></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">@eval.data_analysis</span></td><td><code>"data_analysis"</code></td><td></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">@eval.creative</span></td><td><code>"creative"</code></td><td></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">@eval.multi_agent</span></td><td><code>"tool_use"</code></td><td>AgentCoordination 활성</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">@eval.secure</span></td><td><code>"qa"</code></td><td>security_metrics 임시 활성</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">@eval.streaming</span></td><td><code>"qa"</code></td><td>TTFT 자동 기록</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <div class="slbl">주요 메서드</div>
      <table class="mtable">
        <thead><tr><th>메서드</th><th>반환</th><th>설명</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><span class="p">save(filename=None)</span></td><td><span class="r">None</span></td><td>JSON + HTML 저장</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">gate(tcr=None, accuracy=None, quality=None, hallucination=None)</span></td><td><span class="r">None</span></td><td>임계값 미달 시 sys.exit(1). CI/CD 게이팅.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">summary()</span></td><td><span class="r">Dict</span></td><td>tcr·accuracy·p95_latency·total_cost_usd 등 핵심 지표 요약</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">compare(other)</span></td><td><span class="r">Dict</span></td><td>두 QuickEval 인스턴스 지표 비교</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">for_rag(output_dir, **kw)</span></td><td><span class="r">QuickEval</span></td><td>classmethod. hallucination_detection=True 자동 적용</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">for_security(output_dir, **kw)</span></td><td><span class="r">QuickEval</span></td><td>classmethod. enable_security_metrics=True 자동 적용</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">for_llm_judge(output_dir, model, **kw)</span></td><td><span class="r">QuickEval</span></td><td>classmethod. LLMJudge 자동 설정</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">for_regression_eval(output_dir, baseline_file, **kw)</span></td><td><span class="r">QuickEval</span></td><td>classmethod. baseline 대비 성능 저하 감지</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
<pre style="margin-top:10px"><span class="kw">from</span> <span class="cn">agent_evaluator</span> <span class="kw">import</span> QuickEval

