<!-- ── @agent_eval 데코레이터 ── -->
<section class="sec" id="decorators">
  <div class="sec-title">🎯 @agent_eval <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:400;color:var(--text2);margin-left:8px">v0.7.1+ · 단일 태스크</span></div>
  <div class="sec-sub">함수 위에 한 줄로 평가를 삽입. 실행 시간·토큰·도구 호출을 자동 측정하고 TaskResult를 PerformanceMonitor에 기록합니다.</div>
  <div class="cls-card">
    <div class="cls-head"><span class="cls-name">agent_eval</span><span class="kind fn">decorator</span><span class="cls-src">agent_evaluator.decorators</span></div>
    <div class="cls-body">
      <div class="slbl">파라미터</div>
      {% call param_table() %}
          <tr><td><span class="p">monitor</span><span class="req">✦</span></td><td><span class="t">PerformanceMonitor</span></td><td>—</td><td>결과를 기록할 모니터 인스턴스</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">task_type</span><span class="req">✦</span></td><td><span class="t">str</span></td><td>—</td><td>TaskType 소문자 문자열 (e.g. <code>"qa"</code>, <code>"tool_use"</code>, <code>"information_retrieval"</code>)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">framework</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">FrameworkLiteral</span></td><td><code>None</code></td><td>응답 객체에서 토큰/도구/chain_steps 자동 추출 (21개 지원)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">task_id_prefix</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">str</span></td><td><code>"task"</code></td><td>자동 생성 task_id 접두사</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">task_id_fn</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">Callable</span></td><td><code>None</code></td><td><code>(args, kwargs) → str</code> 동적 task_id 생성</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">flush_every</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">int</span></td><td><code>0</code></td><td>N 호출마다 save_to_file() 자동 실행 (0=비활성)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">alert_rules</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">List[SimpleTaskAlertRule]</span></td><td><code>[]</code></td><td>태스크 완료 시 실행할 알림 규칙 목록</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">rag_mode</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">bool</span></td><td><code>False</code></td><td>hallucination_detection + <code>information_retrieval</code> task_type 자동 적용</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">enable_hallucination_detection</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">bool</span></td><td><code>False</code></td><td>이 호출에서만 hallucination detection 강제 활성</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">security</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">SecurityConfig</span></td><td><code>None</code></td><td>보안 5종 지표 설정 — <code>SecurityConfig(enable_security_metrics=True)</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">llm_judge</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">LLMJudgeConfig</span></td><td><code>None</code></td><td>LLM Judge 설정 — <code>LLMJudgeConfig(model="claude-sonnet-4-6", criteria=["accuracy"])</code>. 기본 설치에 포함 (API 키 필요)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">retry</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">RetryConfig</span></td><td><code>None</code></td><td>재시도 정책 — <code>RetryConfig(max=3, delay=1.0, backoff=2.0)</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">sample_rate</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">float</span></td><td><code>1.0</code></td><td>샘플링 비율 (0–1). 비용 제어용</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">sample_condition</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">Callable</span></td><td><code>None</code></td><td><code>(args, kwargs) → bool</code> 조건부 샘플링</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">on_record</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">Callable</span></td><td><code>None</code></td><td><code>(TaskResult) → TaskResult|None</code> 기록 후 후처리 훅</td></tr>
          <tr style="background:var(--bg3)"><td colspan="4" style="font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);padding:6px 10px;font-size:12px">🔧 Harness Engineering Config (v0.8.0+) — 7개 Gate · 33개 Config <a href="#harness-a" style="color:var(--text2);font-weight:400;font-size:11px;margin-left:4px">→ 상세 레퍼런스</a></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">instructions</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">InstructionConfig</span></td><td><code>None</code></td><td>Gate A — 지시 이행률·형식·키워드 검증. <a href="#harness-a" style="color:var(--accent)">→ GoalAlignmentConfig, PlanConfig 등 6종</a></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">loop_detection</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">LoopDetectionConfig</span></td><td><code>None</code></td><td>Gate B — 반복 루프 탐지. <a href="#harness-b" style="color:var(--accent)">→ ScopeConfig, StateConsistencyConfig, DeadlockConfig 등 6종</a></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">reproducibility</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">ReproducibilityConfig</span></td><td><code>None</code></td><td>Gate C — 재현 가능성. <a href="#harness-c" style="color:var(--accent)">→ FaultToleranceConfig, RetryConsistencyConfig 등 5종</a></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">sla</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">SLAConfig</span></td><td><code>None</code></td><td>Gate D — SLA 응답시간 계약. <a href="#harness-d" style="color:var(--accent)">→ EfficiencyConfig, ResourceBudgetConfig 등 5종</a></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">threat_severity</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">ThreatSeverityConfig</span></td><td><code>None</code></td><td>Gate E — 위협 심각도 분류. <a href="#harness-e" style="color:var(--accent)">→ ComplianceConfig, ThreatResponseConfig 3종</a></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">consensus</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">ConsensusConfig</span></td><td><code>None</code></td><td>Gate F — 에이전트 간 합의율. <a href="#harness-f" style="color:var(--accent)">→ PropagationConfig, AgentRoleConfig, ConflictResolutionConfig 4종</a></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">explainability</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">ExplainabilityConfig</span></td><td><code>None</code></td><td>Gate G — 추론 설명 가능성. <a href="#harness-g" style="color:var(--accent)">→ ObservabilityConfig, ErrorDiagnosisConfig, LatencyAttributionConfig 4종</a></td></tr>
      {% endcall %}
      <div class="slbl">함수 시그니처 규칙</div>
      <div class="note tip">💡 파라미터명 <code>question</code>·<code>ground_truth</code>·<code>context</code>가 있으면 자동 인식합니다. 다른 이름을 쓸 경우 <code>question_arg</code>·<code>ground_truth_arg</code>·<code>context_arg</code> 파라미터로 매핑하세요.</div>
<pre style="margin-top:10px"><span class="kw">from</span> <span class="cn">agent_evaluator</span> <span class="kw">import</span> PerformanceMonitor
<span class="kw">from</span> <span class="cn">agent_evaluator.decorators</span> <span class="kw">import</span> agent_eval, EvalMetadata

monitor = <span class="fn">PerformanceMonitor</span>(output_dir=<span class="st">"results/"</span>)

<span class="cm"># 기본 — 실행시간·정확도 자동 측정</span>
<span class="de">@agent_eval</span>(monitor, task_type=<span class="st">"qa"</span>)
<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">my_agent</span>(question: str, ground_truth: str = <span class="st">""</span>) -> str:
    <span class="kw">return</span> llm.<span class="fn">invoke</span>(question)

<span class="cm"># 프레임워크 자동 추출 (tool_calls, tokens_used, chain_steps)</span>
<span class="de">@agent_eval</span>(monitor, task_type=<span class="st">"tool_use"</span>, framework=<span class="st">"openai"</span>)
<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">openai_agent</span>(question: str, ground_truth: str = <span class="st">""</span>):
    <span class="kw">return</span> client.chat.completions.<span class="fn">create</span>(model=<span class="st">"gpt-4o-mini"</span>, messages=[{<span class="st">"role"</span>:<span class="st">"user"</span>,<span class="st">"content"</span>:question}])

<span class="cm"># EvalMetadata 튜플 반환 — 점수·도구·토큰 수동 주입</span>
<span class="de">@agent_eval</span>(monitor, task_type=<span class="st">"tool_use"</span>)
<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">tool_agent</span>(question: str, ground_truth: str = <span class="st">""</span>) -> tuple:
    resp = my_tool.<span class="fn">run</span>(question)
    <span class="kw">return</span> resp, <span class="fn">EvalMetadata</span>(
        tokens_used={<span class="st">"input"</span>: <span class="nm">200</span>, <span class="st">"output"</span>: <span class="nm">150</span>},
        tool_calls=[{<span class="st">"tool"</span>: <span class="st">"search"</span>, <span class="st">"query"</span>: question}],
        expected_tools=[<span class="st">"search"</span>, <span class="st">"calculator"</span>],   <span class="cm"># F1 계산용</span>
        accuracy_score=<span class="nm">0.95</span>,
    )

<span class="cm"># RAG 모드 — hallucination_detection 자동 활성</span>
<span class="de">@agent_eval</span>(monitor, task_type=<span class="st">"information_retrieval"</span>, rag_mode=<span class="kw">True</span>)
<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">rag_agent</span>(question: str, context: str = <span class="st">""</span>, ground_truth: str = <span class="st">""</span>) -> str:
    <span class="kw">return</span> rag.<span class="fn">run</span>(question, context)

<span class="cm"># 보안 모드 — InputSanitization·OutputLeakage 등 5종 임시 활성</span>
<span class="de">@agent_eval</span>(monitor, task_type=<span class="st">"qa"</span>, security=<span class="fn">SecurityConfig</span>(enable_security_metrics=<span class="kw">True</span>))
<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">secure_agent</span>(question: str, ground_truth: str = <span class="st">""</span>) -> str:
    <span class="kw">return</span> agent.<span class="fn">run</span>(question)

<span class="cm"># LLM Judge + 주기 저장 조합</span>
<span class="de">@agent_eval</span>(monitor, task_type=<span class="st">"qa"</span>,
             llm_judge=<span class="fn">LLMJudgeConfig</span>(model=<span class="st">"claude-sonnet-4-6"</span>),
             flush_every=<span class="nm">50</span>)
<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">prod_agent</span>(question: str, ground_truth: str = <span class="st">""</span>) -> str:
    <span class="kw">return</span> llm.<span class="fn">invoke</span>(question)

<span class="cm"># 비동기 함수 그대로 지원</span>
<span class="de">@agent_eval</span>(monitor, task_type=<span class="st">"qa"</span>)
<span class="kw">async def</span> <span class="fn">async_agent</span>(question: str, ground_truth: str = <span class="st">""</span>) -> str:
    <span class="kw">return await</span> llm.<span class="fn">ainvoke</span>(question)</pre>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── @batch_eval ── -->
<section class="sec" id="batch-eval">
  <div class="sec-title">📦 @batch_eval <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:400;color:var(--text2);margin-left:8px">v0.7.1+ · 배치 평가</span></div>
  <div class="sec-sub">리스트 입력을 받아 한 번에 여러 태스크를 평가합니다. 각 항목이 독립적인 TaskResult로 기록됩니다.</div>
  <div class="cls-card">
    <div class="cls-head"><span class="cls-name">batch_eval</span><span class="kind fn">decorator</span><span class="cls-src">agent_evaluator.decorators</span></div>
    <div class="cls-body">
      <div class="slbl">파라미터</div>
      {% call param_table() %}
          <tr><td><span class="p">monitor</span><span class="req">✦</span></td><td><span class="t">PerformanceMonitor</span></td><td>—</td><td>결과를 기록할 모니터 인스턴스 (List 전달 시 다중 모니터 동시 기록)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">task_type</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">str</span></td><td><code>"qa"</code></td><td>TaskType 소문자 문자열</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">questions_arg</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">str</span></td><td><code>"questions"</code></td><td>질문 리스트를 담는 함수 파라미터명</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">ground_truths_arg</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">str</span></td><td><code>"ground_truths"</code></td><td>정답 리스트를 담는 함수 파라미터명</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">framework</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">FrameworkLiteral</span></td><td><code>"native"</code></td><td>21개 프레임워크 메타데이터 자동 추출</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">concurrency</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">int</span></td><td><code>0</code></td><td>항목별 병렬 실행 상한 (asyncio.gather). 0=순차 처리</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">item_timeout</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">float</span></td><td><code>None</code></td><td>항목별 타임아웃 (초)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">on_item_error</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">Callable</span></td><td><code>None</code></td><td><code>(exception, item_idx) → None</code> 개별 항목 오류 처리 콜백</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">return_format</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">str</span></td><td><code>"list"</code></td><td><code>"list"</code> | <code>"tuple"</code> | <code>"dataframe"</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">flush_every</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">int</span></td><td><code>0</code></td><td>N 배치 호출마다 save_to_file() 자동 실행</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">alert_rules</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">List[SimpleTaskAlertRule]</span></td><td><code>[]</code></td><td>알림 규칙 목록</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">llm_judge</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">LLMJudgeConfig</span></td><td><code>None</code></td><td>배치 전체에 LLM Judge 적용 — <code>LLMJudgeConfig(model=..., criteria=[...])</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">security</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">SecurityConfig</span></td><td><code>None</code></td><td>보안 5종 지표 설정 — <code>SecurityConfig(enable_security_metrics=True)</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">on_batch_complete</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">Callable</span></td><td><code>None</code></td><td><code>(results: list) → None</code> 배치 완료 후 훅</td></tr>
      {% endcall %}
      <div class="note tip" style="margin-top:8px">💡 함수 시그니처: <code>(questions: list, ground_truths: list = None) → list</code>. 반환 리스트와 입력 리스트의 인덱스가 1:1 매핑됩니다. <code>questions_arg</code>/<code>ground_truths_arg</code>로 파라미터명 재매핑 가능.</div>
<pre style="margin-top:10px"><span class="kw">from</span> <span class="cn">agent_evaluator.decorators</span> <span class="kw">import</span> batch_eval

<span class="cm"># 기본 배치 평가</span>
<span class="de">@batch_eval</span>(monitor, task_type=<span class="st">"qa"</span>, flush_every=<span class="nm">20</span>)
<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">batch_agent</span>(questions: list, ground_truths: list = <span class="kw">None</span>) -> list:
    <span class="kw">return</span> [llm.<span class="fn">invoke</span>(q) <span class="kw">for</span> q <span class="kw">in</span> questions]

batch_agent(
    questions=[<span class="st">"Q1"</span>, <span class="st">"Q2"</span>, <span class="st">"Q3"</span>],
    ground_truths=[<span class="st">"A1"</span>, <span class="st">"A2"</span>, <span class="st">"A3"</span>],
)

<span class="cm"># 병렬 처리 — concurrency=8로 상한 설정 (asyncio.gather)</span>
<span class="de">@batch_eval</span>(monitor, task_type=<span class="st">"qa"</span>, concurrency=<span class="nm">8</span>)
<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">parallel_agent</span>(questions: list, ground_truths: list = <span class="kw">None</span>) -> list:
    <span class="kw">return</span> [llm.<span class="fn">invoke</span>(q) <span class="kw">for</span> q <span class="kw">in</span> questions]

<span class="cm"># DataFrame 반환 (task_id, accuracy_score, completion_score, tokens_total ... 포함)</span>
<span class="de">@batch_eval</span>(monitor, task_type=<span class="st">"tool_use"</span>, return_format=<span class="st">"dataframe"</span>)
<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">df_agent</span>(questions: list, ground_truths: list = <span class="kw">None</span>) -> list:
    <span class="kw">return</span> [agent.<span class="fn">run</span>(q) <span class="kw">for</span> q <span class="kw">in</span> questions]

df = <span class="fn">df_agent</span>(questions=[...], ground_truths=[...])
<span class="cm"># df.columns → ['task_id', 'task_type', 'success', 'accuracy_score', ...]</span>

<span class="cm"># 오류 콜백 + 항목 타임아웃</span>
<span class="de">@batch_eval</span>(monitor, task_type=<span class="st">"qa"</span>,
             on_item_error=<span class="kw">lambda</span> exc, idx: <span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="st">f"[ERR] item {idx}: {exc}"</span>),
             item_timeout=<span class="nm">30.0</span>)
<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">robust_agent</span>(questions: list, ground_truths: list = <span class="kw">None</span>) -> list:
    <span class="kw">return</span> [risky_call(q) <span class="kw">for</span> q <span class="kw">in</span> questions]</pre>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── @conversation_eval ── -->
<section class="sec" id="conversation-eval">
  <div class="sec-title">💬 @conversation_eval <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:400;color:var(--text2);margin-left:8px">v0.7.1+ · 멀티턴 대화</span></div>
  <div class="sec-sub">멀티턴 대화를 세션 단위로 평가합니다. 동일 <code>session_id</code>로 호출하면 자동으로 턴이 누산되고 세션 종료 시 <code>ConversationMetrics</code>를 기록합니다.</div>
  <div class="cls-card">
    <div class="cls-head"><span class="cls-name">conversation_eval</span><span class="kind fn">decorator</span><span class="cls-src">agent_evaluator.decorators</span></div>
    <div class="cls-body">
      <div class="slbl">파라미터</div>
      {% call param_table() %}
          <tr><td><span class="p">monitor</span><span class="req">✦</span></td><td><span class="t">PerformanceMonitor</span></td><td>—</td><td>결과를 기록할 모니터 인스턴스</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">session_id_arg</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">str</span></td><td><code>"session_id"</code></td><td>세션 ID를 담는 함수 파라미터명. 함수에 <code>session_id: str</code>이 있으면 자동 인식.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">user_arg</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">str</span></td><td><code>"question"</code></td><td>사용자 발화를 담는 함수 파라미터명</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">max_turns</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">int</span></td><td><code>None</code></td><td>세션당 최대 턴 수 제한</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">max_turns_exceeded_action</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">str</span></td><td><code>"flush"</code></td><td><code>"flush"</code> | <code>"warn"</code> | <code>"error"</code> — 최대 턴 초과 시 동작</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">max_session_seconds</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">float</span></td><td><code>None</code></td><td>세션 비활성 자동 flush 타이머 (초)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">flush_every</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">int</span></td><td><code>0</code></td><td>N세션마다 save_to_file() 자동 실행</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">on_turn</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">Callable</span></td><td><code>None</code></td><td><code>(session_id, user, response, metadata) → None</code> 턴 완료 훅</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">on_flush</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">Callable</span></td><td><code>None</code></td><td><code>(metrics, session_id) → None</code> 세션 flush 완료 훅</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">session_score_fn</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">Callable</span></td><td><code>None</code></td><td><code>(ConversationMetrics) → float</code> 커스텀 세션 점수</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">llm_judge</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">LLMJudgeConfig</span></td><td><code>None</code></td><td>세션별 LLM Judge 적용</td></tr>
      {% endcall %}
      <div class="slbl">ConversationMetrics — 자동 산출되는 지표</div>
      <table class="mtable" style="margin-bottom:10px">
        <thead><tr><th>필드</th><th>범위</th><th>설명</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><span class="p">turn_count</span></td><td><span class="r">int</span></td><td>총 대화 턴 수</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">context_retention_score</span></td><td><span class="r">0–1</span></td><td>이전 발화 정보 보존율</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">topic_coherence_score</span></td><td><span class="r">0–1</span></td><td>대화 주제 일관성</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">progressive_depth_score</span></td><td><span class="r">0–1</span></td><td>대화 심화 진행도</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">session_completion_score</span></td><td><span class="r">0–1</span></td><td>세션 완결성 (응답 길이 기반)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">overall_score</span></td><td><span class="r">0–1</span></td><td>4차원 가중 평균</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">avg_turn_latency</span></td><td><span class="r">float</span></td><td>턴당 평균 응답 시간 (초)</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
<pre><span class="kw">from</span> <span class="cn">agent_evaluator.decorators</span> <span class="kw">import</span> conversation_eval

<span class="cm"># 기본 — session_id 파라미터로 자동 세션 분리</span>
<span class="de">@conversation_eval</span>(monitor, flush_every=<span class="nm">10</span>)
<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">chat_agent</span>(user_input: str, session_id: str = <span class="st">""</span>) -> str:
    <span class="kw">return</span> llm.<span class="fn">invoke</span>(user_input)

<span class="cm"># 동일 session_id로 호출 → 자동으로 멀티턴 누산</span>
chat_agent(<span class="st">"안녕하세요!"</span>, session_id=<span class="st">"user_001"</span>)
chat_agent(<span class="st">"오늘 날씨 어때요?"</span>, session_id=<span class="st">"user_001"</span>)
chat_agent(<span class="st">"그럼 주말 계획 추천해줘"</span>, session_id=<span class="st">"user_001"</span>)
<span class="cm"># → context_retention, topic_coherence, progressive_depth 자동 집계</span>

<span class="cm"># 다른 user → 별도 세션</span>
chat_agent(<span class="st">"파이썬 배우고 싶어요"</span>, session_id=<span class="st">"user_002"</span>)
chat_agent(<span class="st">"어떻게 시작하면 돼요?"</span>, session_id=<span class="st">"user_002"</span>)

<span class="cm"># 커스텀 점수 함수 + 턴 완료 훅</span>
<span class="de">@conversation_eval</span>(
    monitor,
    session_score_fn=<span class="kw">lambda</span> m: (m.context_retention_score + m.topic_coherence_score) / <span class="nm">2</span>,
    on_turn=<span class="kw">lambda</span> sid, idx, u, r: <span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="st">f"[Turn {idx}] {sid}: {r[:50]}"</span>),
    max_turns=<span class="nm">20</span>, max_turns_exceeded_action=<span class="st">"flush"</span>,
)
<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">monitored_chat</span>(user_input: str, session_id: str = <span class="st">""</span>) -> str:
    <span class="kw">return</span> llm.<span class="fn">invoke</span>(user_input)

<span class="cm"># 비동기 지원</span>
<span class="de">@conversation_eval</span>(monitor)
<span class="kw">async def</span> <span class="fn">async_chat</span>(user_input: str, session_id: str = <span class="st">""</span>) -> str:
    <span class="kw">return await</span> llm.<span class="fn">ainvoke</span>(user_input)</pre>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── eval_context ── -->
<section class="sec" id="eval-context">
  <div class="sec-title">🔄 eval_context <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:400;color:var(--text2);margin-left:8px">v0.7.2+ · 인라인 평가</span></div>
  <div class="sec-sub"><code>with</code> 블록으로 외부 함수 호출을 평가합니다. 데코레이터 적용이 어려운 서드파티 코드나 인터랙티브 테스트에 적합합니다.</div>
  <div class="cls-card">
    <div class="cls-head"><span class="cls-name">eval_context</span><span class="kind ctx">@contextmanager</span><span class="cls-src">agent_evaluator.decorators</span></div>
    <div class="cls-body">
      <div class="slbl">파라미터</div>
      {% call param_table() %}
          <tr><td><span class="p">monitor</span><span class="req">✦</span></td><td><span class="t">PerformanceMonitor</span></td><td>—</td><td>결과를 기록할 모니터 인스턴스</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">task_type</span><span class="req">✦</span></td><td><span class="t">str</span></td><td>—</td><td>TaskType 소문자 문자열</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">question</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">str</span></td><td><code>""</code></td><td>평가 대상 질문</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">ground_truth</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">str</span></td><td><code>""</code></td><td>정답</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">task_id</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">str</span></td><td>auto</td><td>태스크 ID (미지정 시 UUID 자동 생성)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">timeout</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">float</span></td><td><code>None</code></td><td>블록 타임아웃 (초)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">alert_rules</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">List[SimpleTaskAlertRule]</span></td><td><code>[]</code></td><td>알림 규칙 목록</td></tr>
      {% endcall %}
      <div class="note" style="margin-top:8px">🔧 <code>ctx.response</code>에 응답을 할당하면 블록 종료 시 자동으로 TaskResult가 기록됩니다. 스트리밍 청크는 <code>ctx.chunk_step(chunk)</code>으로 기록합니다.</div>
<pre style="margin-top:10px"><span class="kw">from</span> <span class="cn">agent_evaluator.decorators</span> <span class="kw">import</span> eval_context

<span class="cm"># 기본 사용 — 외부 함수 결과를 ctx.response에 할당</span>
<span class="kw">with</span> <span class="fn">eval_context</span>(monitor, <span class="st">"qa"</span>,
                  question=<span class="st">"한국의 수도는?"</span>,
                  ground_truth=<span class="st">"서울"</span>) <span class="kw">as</span> ctx:
    ctx.response = third_party_llm.<span class="fn">ask</span>(<span class="st">"한국의 수도는?"</span>)
<span class="cm"># 블록 종료 → 실행시간·정확도 자동 기록</span>

<span class="cm"># 스트리밍 — chunk_step()으로 TTFT 자동 기록</span>
<span class="kw">with</span> <span class="fn">eval_context</span>(monitor, <span class="st">"qa"</span>, question=<span class="st">"설명해줘"</span>) <span class="kw">as</span> ctx:
    chunks = []
    <span class="kw">for</span> chunk <span class="kw">in</span> streaming_llm.<span class="fn">stream</span>(<span class="st">"설명해줘"</span>):
        chunks.<span class="fn">append</span>(chunk)
        ctx.<span class="fn">chunk_step</span>(chunk)   <span class="cm"># 첫 청크 → TTFT 자동 기록</span>
    ctx.response = <span class="st">""</span>.<span class="fn">join</span>(chunks)

<span class="cm"># 중첩 컨텍스트 (ctx.depth 로 깊이 추적)</span>
<span class="kw">with</span> <span class="fn">eval_context</span>(monitor, <span class="st">"tool_use"</span>, question=<span class="st">"복합 태스크"</span>) <span class="kw">as</span> outer:
    <span class="kw">with</span> <span class="fn">eval_context</span>(monitor, <span class="st">"qa"</span>, question=<span class="st">"하위 태스크"</span>) <span class="kw">as</span> inner:
        inner.response = sub_agent.<span class="fn">run</span>(<span class="st">"하위 태스크"</span>)
    outer.response = main_agent.<span class="fn">run</span>(<span class="st">"복합 태스크"</span>)</pre>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── PerformanceMonitor ── -->
<section class="sec" id="performance-monitor">
  <div class="sec-title">🎛️ PerformanceMonitor</div>
  <div class="sec-sub">Layer 1+2 트래커 16종을 내부에서 조율하는 중앙 오케스트레이터. 데코레이터가 내부적으로 호출하는 핵심 클래스입니다.</div>
  <div class="cls-card">
    <div class="cls-head">
      <span class="cls-name">PerformanceMonitor</span><span class="kind cls">class</span>
      <span class="cls-src">agent_evaluator.core.agent_evaluator</span>
    </div>
    <div class="cls-body">
      <div class="slbl">생성자 파라미터</div>
      {% call param_table() %}
          <tr><td><span class="p">output_dir</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">str</span></td><td><code>"results/"</code></td><td>JSON/HTML 리포트 저장 디렉토리</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">pricing</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">Dict[str,float]</span></td><td><code>{"input":0.003,"output":0.015}</code></td><td>1K 토큰당 비용 (USD). TokenEconomyTracker에 전달됩니다.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">enable_hallucination_detection</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">bool</span></td><td><code>False</code></td><td>HallucinationDetector 활성화 (LLM 호출 비용 발생)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">enable_security_metrics</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">bool</span></td><td><code>False</code></td><td>Layer 2 보안 트래커 5종 활성화</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">security_config</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">Dict</span></td><td><code>None</code></td><td>ToolAuthorizationTracker 설정 (allowed_tools, restricted_tools 등)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">enable_llm_judge</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">bool</span></td><td><code>False</code></td><td>LLM-as-Judge 자동 채점 활성화. 5차원(완결성·관련성·사실 일관성·독성·편향) 자동 적용.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">judge_model</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">str|None</span></td><td><code>None</code></td><td>Judge 모델. None → <code>agent-eval init</code> 설정 자동 감지.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">judge_sample_rate</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">float</span></td><td><code>0.1</code></td><td>Judge 평가 비율 (0.0–1.0). 비용 제어용.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">judge_budget_per_day</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">float|None</span></td><td><code>None</code></td><td>일일 Judge 예산 한도 (USD). 초과 시 judge 건너뜀.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">judge_criteria</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">List[str]|None</span></td><td><code>None</code></td><td>G-Eval 커스텀 평가 기준 목록 (DeepEval 대체). 예: <code>["medical_accuracy", "empathy"]</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">enable_anomaly_detection</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">bool</span></td><td><code>False</code></td><td>save_to_file() 시 AnomalyDetector.scan() 자동 실행. 결과가 anomaly_data에 저장됨.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">anomaly_baseline_window</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">int</span></td><td><code>100</code></td><td>기준선 계산에 사용할 최대 태스크 수.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">anomaly_detection_window</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">int</span></td><td><code>20</code></td><td>현재 상태 비교에 사용할 최근 태스크 수.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">enable_transparency</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">bool</span></td><td><code>False</code></td><td>TestTransparencyManager 활성화</td></tr>
      {% endcall %}
      <div class="slbl">주요 메서드</div>
      <table class="mtable">
        <thead><tr><th>메서드 시그니처</th><th>반환</th><th>설명</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><span class="p">record_task(result, ground_truth=None, context=None, request=None, response=None, expected_elements=None)</span></td><td><span class="r">PerformanceMonitor</span></td><td>TaskResult를 모든 활성 트래커에 기록. <code>self</code> 반환으로 메서드 체이닝 가능.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">generate_report()</span></td><td><span class="r">EvaluationReport</span></td><td>수집 데이터를 집계해 EvaluationReport 객체 반환</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">save_to_file(filename)</span></td><td><span class="r">None</span></td><td><code>{output_dir}/{filename}.json</code> + <code>.html</code> 저장. <code>enable_anomaly_detection=True</code> 시 anomaly_data 자동 포함.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">conversation(session_id)</span></td><td><span class="r">ConversationContextManager</span></td><td>멀티턴 대화 평가 컨텍스트 매니저. <code>with monitor.conversation("id") as conv: conv.turn(user=..., agent=...)</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">record_implicit_feedback(task_id, event_type, value=None)</span></td><td><span class="r">None</span></td><td>사용자 반응 신호(like/copy/retry/share) 기록 → feedback_data에 저장</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">evaluate_with_golden_dataset(agent_fn, dataset_path=None, ...)</span></td><td><span class="r">Dict</span></td><td>골든 데이터셋으로 에이전트 자동 평가</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">compare_with_thresholds()</span></td><td><span class="r">Dict</span></td><td>업계 임계값과 현재 지표 비교</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">reset()</span></td><td><span class="r">None</span></td><td>모든 트래커 상태 초기화</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">for_rag_evaluation(**kwargs)</span></td><td><span class="r">PerformanceMonitor</span></td><td>classmethod. RAG 평가 최적 설정 (<code>enable_hallucination_detection=True</code>) 자동 적용.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">for_secure_agents(**kwargs)</span></td><td><span class="r">PerformanceMonitor</span></td><td>classmethod. 보안 평가 최적 설정 (<code>enable_security_metrics=True</code>) 자동 적용.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <div class="note tip" style="margin-top:12px">💡 <strong>데코레이터와의 관계</strong>: <code>@agent_eval</code>, <code>@batch_eval</code>, <code>eval_context</code>는 모두 내부에서 <code>monitor.record_task()</code>를 호출합니다. 직접 호출은 고급 사용 시에만 필요합니다.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── TaskResult ── -->
<section class="sec" id="task-result">
  <div class="sec-title">📋 TaskResult</div>
  <div class="sec-sub">단일 태스크 실행 결과를 담는 <code>dataclass</code>. 데코레이터가 자동 생성하므로 직접 생성할 필요가 없습니다. 내부 구조 이해가 필요한 경우 참고하세요.</div>
  <div class="cls-card">
    <div class="cls-head"><span class="cls-name">TaskResult</span><span class="kind cls">dataclass</span><span class="cls-src">agent_evaluator.core.trackers.base</span></div>
    <div class="cls-body">
      <div class="slbl">필수 필드 (11개)</div>
      {% call field_table() %}
          <tr><td><span class="p">task_id</span></td><td><span class="t">str</span></td><td>태스크 고유 식별자</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">task_type</span></td><td><span class="t">str</span></td><td>TaskType.value 문자열 (e.g. <code>"qa"</code>)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">success</span></td><td><span class="t">bool</span></td><td>태스크 성공 여부</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">completion_score</span></td><td><span class="t">float</span></td><td>완료도 점수 (0.0–1.0). task_type 인식 자동 계산: <code>code_generation</code>/<code>coding</code>은 AST 파싱 성공→1.0, <code>tool_use</code>는 tool_calls 존재→1.0/미존재→0.6, 기타는 응답 길이 기반 (v0.8.0+).</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">accuracy_score</span></td><td><span class="t">float</span></td><td>정확도 점수 (0.0–1.0). TokenOverlapF1(40%)+Jaccard(30%)+LCS(20%)+CharSim/Levenshtein(10%) 가중 조합.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">execution_time</span></td><td><span class="t">float</span></td><td>실행 시간 (초). 데코레이터가 <code>time.perf_counter()</code>로 자동 측정.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">tokens_used</span></td><td><span class="t">Dict[str,int]</span></td><td><code>{"input": N, "output": N, "total": N}</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">tool_calls</span></td><td><span class="t">List[Dict]</span></td><td><code>[{"tool": "name", "input": {...}, "output": "..."}]</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">attempts</span></td><td><span class="t">int</span></td><td>시도 횟수 (1 = 재시도 없음)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">errors</span></td><td><span class="t">List[str]</span></td><td>오류 메시지 목록. 없으면 <code>[]</code>.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">timestamp</span></td><td><span class="t">datetime</span></td><td>기록 시각</td></tr>
      {% endcall %}
      <div class="slbl">선택 필드 (13개)</div>
      {% call field_table(col3='용도') %}
          <tr><td><span class="p">expected_tools</span></td><td><span class="t">Optional[List[str]]</span></td><td>기대 도구 목록 — ToolSelectionTracker F1 계산</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">agent_interactions</span></td><td><span class="t">Optional[List[Dict]]</span></td><td>멀티에이전트 상호작용 (EvalMetadata로 수동 주입)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">chain_steps</span></td><td><span class="t">Optional[List[Dict]]</span></td><td>체인 실행 단계 (framework= 어댑터 자동 추출)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">graph_traversal</span></td><td><span class="t">Optional[Dict]</span></td><td>그래프 순회 경로 (LangGraph)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">conversation_turns</span></td><td><span class="t">Optional[List[Dict]]</span></td><td>대화 턴 기록 (AutoGen)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">state_transitions</span></td><td><span class="t">Optional[List[Dict]]</span></td><td>상태 전이 이력 (LangGraph/AutoGen)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">framework</span></td><td><span class="t">Optional[str]</span></td><td>프레임워크 식별자 (<code>"crewai"</code>, <code>"langchain"</code> 등)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">partial_reason</span></td><td><span class="t">Optional[str]</span></td><td>부분 성공/실패 원인. 예외 시 <code>"execution_error"</code> 자동 설정.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">question</span></td><td><span class="t">Optional[str]</span></td><td>사용자 질문 / 입력 텍스트</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">response</span></td><td><span class="t">Optional[str]</span></td><td>에이전트 응답 텍스트</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">ground_truth</span></td><td><span class="t">Optional[str]</span></td><td>기대 정답</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">context</span></td><td><span class="t">Optional[str]</span></td><td>RAG 검색 컨텍스트 — HallucinationDetector 사실 일관성 검증에 사용</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">llm_judge</span></td><td><span class="t">Optional[Dict]</span></td><td>LLM Judge 결과. <code>enable_llm_judge=True</code> 시 자동 설정.</td></tr>
      {% endcall %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── TaskType ── -->
