<!-- ── TaskCompletionTracker ── -->
<section class="sec" id="tcr">
  <div class="sec-title"><span class="badge l1">L1</span> TaskCompletionTracker</div>
  <div class="sec-sub">성공/실패를 집계하고 태스크 유형별 완료율(TCR)을 산출합니다.</div>
  <div class="cls-card">
    <div class="cls-head"><span class="cls-name">TaskCompletionTracker</span><span class="kind cls">class</span><span class="cls-src">core.agent_evaluator</span></div>
    <div class="cls-desc">생성자 파라미터 없음. <code>PerformanceMonitor</code> 내부에서 자동으로 인스턴스화됩니다. 독립 사용 시 직접 생성 가능.</div>
    <div class="cls-body">
      {% call tracker_table() %}
          <tr><td><span class="p">add_task(task)</span></td><td><span class="t">task: TaskResult</span></td><td>—</td></tr>
          <tr>
            <td><span class="p">calculate_tcr(task_type=None)</span></td>
            <td><span class="t">task_type: Optional[str]</span></td>
            <td><code class="t">tcr</code>, <code class="t">total_tasks</code>, <code class="t">full_success</code>, <code class="t">partial_success</code>, <code class="t">failures</code>, <code class="t">success_rate</code></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><span class="p">get_tcr_by_type()</span></td>
            <td>—</td>
            <td><code class="t">Dict[task_type → {tcr, total, ...}]</code></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><span class="p">get_benchmark_status(tcr)</span></td>
            <td><span class="t">tcr: float</span></td>
            <td><code class="t">"Industry Leading" | "Good" | "Acceptable" | "Needs Improvement"</code></td>
          </tr>
      {% endcall %}
<pre style="margin-top:10px"><span class="kw">from</span> <span class="cn">agent_evaluator</span> <span class="kw">import</span> TaskCompletionTracker, create_taskresult

tracker = <span class="fn">TaskCompletionTracker</span>()
tracker.<span class="fn">add_task</span>(<span class="fn">create_taskresult</span>(...))
result = tracker.<span class="fn">calculate_tcr</span>()
<span class="cm"># → {'tcr': 0.92, 'total_tasks': 50, 'full_success': 44, 'failures': 4, 'success_rate': 0.92}</span>
by_type = tracker.<span class="fn">get_tcr_by_type</span>()
status = tracker.<span class="fn">get_benchmark_status</span>(result[<span class="st">'tcr'</span>])  <span class="cm"># → "Good Performance"</span></pre>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── AccuracyEvaluator ── -->
<section class="sec" id="accuracy">
  <div class="sec-title"><span class="badge l1">L1</span> AccuracyEvaluator</div>
  <div class="sec-sub">QA·코드·일반 태스크에 걸쳐 정확도를 산출합니다. 유형별로 전략이 자동 선택됩니다.</div>
  <div class="cls-card">
    <div class="cls-head"><span class="cls-name">AccuracyEvaluator</span><span class="kind cls">class</span><span class="cls-src">core.agent_evaluator</span></div>
    <div class="cls-body">
      {% call tracker_table() %}
          <tr><td><span class="p">add_evaluation(task_id, ground_truth, prediction, task_type)</span></td><td><span class="t">str, Any, Any, str</span></td><td>—</td></tr>
          <tr>
            <td><span class="p">get_accuracy_scores()</span></td><td>—</td>
            <td><code class="t">overall_accuracy</code>, <code class="t">median_accuracy</code>, <code class="t">min_accuracy</code>, <code class="t">max_accuracy</code>, <code class="t">std_accuracy</code> (0–100 스케일)</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><span class="p">get_accuracy_by_type()</span></td><td>—</td>
            <td><code class="t">Dict[task_type → float]</code> — 유형별 평균 정확도</td>
          </tr>
      {% endcall %}
      <div class="note tip" style="margin-top:8px">📐 <strong>정확도 계산 가중치</strong>: TokenOverlapF1 40% + Jaccard 30% + LCS 20% + CharSimilarity(Levenshtein) 10% — F1은 정밀도×재현율 조화평균(패딩 방지), Char는 Levenshtein 거리 기반(문자 순서 반영)</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

