<section class="sec" id="llm-judge">
  <div class="sec-title">✨ LLMJudge <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:400;color:var(--text2);margin-left:8px">v0.7.5+</span></div>
  <div class="sec-sub"><code>ground_truth</code> 없이 LLM이 직접 응답 품질을 <strong>5차원</strong>(완결성·관련성·사실 일관성·독성·편향) 채점합니다. <code>rag_mode=True</code> 시 <strong>Faithfulness</strong>(RAG) 차원 자동 추가, <code>judge_criteria</code> 설정 시 <strong>G-Eval 커스텀</strong> 기준 추가. OpenAI / Anthropic Claude 모두 지원.</div>
  <div class="cls-card">
    <div class="cls-head"><span class="cls-name">LLMJudge</span><span class="kind cls">class</span><span class="cls-src">agent_evaluator.integrations.llm_judge</span></div>
    <div class="cls-desc">비용 제어 샘플링(<code>sample_rate</code>)과 일일 예산 한도(<code>budget_per_day</code>)를 내장한 LLM-as-Judge 엔진.</div>
    <div class="cls-body">
      <table class="mtable"><thead><tr><th>파라미터</th><th>타입</th><th>기본값</th><th>설명</th></tr></thead><tbody>
        <tr><td><span class="p">model</span></td><td><span class="t">str|None</span></td><td><span class="r">None</span></td><td><code>agent-eval init</code> 설정 자동 감지. 명시 시 해당 모델 사용</td></tr>
        <tr><td><span class="p">sample_rate</span></td><td><span class="t">float</span></td><td><span class="r">1.0</span></td><td>평가 비율 (0–1). 비용 제어용</td></tr>
        <tr><td><span class="p">budget_per_day</span></td><td><span class="t">float|None</span></td><td><span class="r">None</span></td><td>일일 예산 한도 (USD). 초과 시 judge 건너뜀</td></tr>
        <tr><td><span class="p">judge_criteria</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">List[str]|None</span></td><td><span class="r">None</span></td><td>G-Eval 커스텀 평가 기준. 예: <code>["medical_accuracy", "empathy"]</code> → <code>criteria_scores</code> 자동 추가 (DeepEval G-Eval 대체)</td></tr>
      </tbody></table>
      <table class="mtable" style="margin-top:12px"><thead><tr><th>메서드</th><th>반환 타입</th><th>설명</th></tr></thead><tbody>
        <tr><td><span class="p">judge(task_id, question, response, context=None)</span></td><td><span class="t">dict</span></td><td>단일 채점. <strong>기본 5개 키</strong>: <code>completeness</code>·<code>relevance</code>·<code>factual_consistency</code>·<code>toxicity</code>·<code>bias</code>·<code>overall</code>·<code>safety_score</code>. <strong>조건부</strong>: <code>faithfulness</code>(rag_mode 시), <code>criteria_scores</code>·<code>criteria_overall</code>(judge_criteria 설정 시)</td></tr>
        <tr><td><span class="p">get_summary()</span></td><td><span class="t">dict</span></td><td>누적 통계 (호출 수, 평균 점수, 총 비용). 결과에 따라 faithfulness·criteria_scores 동적 포함</td></tr>
      </tbody></table>
<pre><span class="cm"># 기본 5차원 채점 (completeness·relevance·factual_consistency·toxicity·bias)</span>
<span class="kw">from</span> <span class="cn">agent_evaluator.decorators</span> <span class="kw">import</span> agent_eval

<span class="de">@agent_eval</span>(monitor, task_type=<span class="st">"qa"</span>,
             enable_llm_judge=<span class="kw">True</span>, judge_model=<span class="st">"claude-sonnet-4-6"</span>,
             judge_sample_rate=<span class="nm">0.1</span>, judge_budget_per_day=<span class="nm">5.0</span>)
<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">my_agent</span>(question: str, ground_truth: str = <span class="st">""</span>) -> str:
    <span class="kw">return</span> llm.<span class="fn">invoke</span>(question)
<span class="cm"># → TaskResult.extra["llm_judge"]: {completeness, relevance, factual_consistency, toxicity, bias, overall, safety_score}</span>

<span class="cm"># RAG Faithfulness (Ragas 대체) — rag_mode=True + enable_llm_judge=True</span>
<span class="de">@agent_eval</span>(monitor, task_type=<span class="st">"information_retrieval"</span>,
             rag_mode=<span class="kw">True</span>, enable_llm_judge=<span class="kw">True</span>, judge_model=<span class="st">"claude-sonnet-4-6"</span>)
<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">rag_agent</span>(question: str, context: str = <span class="st">""</span>, ground_truth: str = <span class="st">""</span>) -> str:
    <span class="kw">return</span> rag_chain.<span class="fn">invoke</span>({"input": question, "context": context})
<span class="cm"># → extra["llm_judge"]["faithfulness"] 자동 추가 (0–5, 5=모든 주장이 컨텍스트에 근거)</span>

<span class="cm"># G-Eval 커스텀 기준 (DeepEval 대체) — judge_criteria 지정</span>
<span class="de">@agent_eval</span>(monitor, task_type=<span class="st">"qa"</span>,
             enable_llm_judge=<span class="kw">True</span>, judge_criteria=[<span class="st">"medical_accuracy"</span>, <span class="st">"empathy"</span>, <span class="st">"clarity"</span>])
<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">medical_agent</span>(question: str, ground_truth: str = <span class="st">""</span>) -> str:
    <span class="kw">return</span> llm.<span class="fn">invoke</span>(question)
<span class="cm"># → extra["llm_judge"]["criteria_scores"]: {"medical_accuracy": 4.0, "empathy": 4.5, "clarity": 4.8}</span>
<span class="cm"># → extra["llm_judge"]["criteria_overall"]: 4.43</span>

<span class="cm"># PerformanceMonitor 레벨에서 전역 활성 + judge_criteria</span>
monitor = <span class="fn">PerformanceMonitor</span>(
    output_dir=<span class="st">"results/"</span>,
    enable_llm_judge=<span class="kw">True</span>,
    judge_model=<span class="st">"claude-sonnet-4-6"</span>,
    judge_sample_rate=<span class="nm">0.1</span>,
    judge_criteria=[<span class="st">"professionalism"</span>, <span class="st">"safety"</span>],
)

<span class="cm"># QuickEval 팩토리로 최소 설정</span>
<span class="kw">from</span> <span class="cn">agent_evaluator</span> <span class="kw">import</span> QuickEval
eval = <span class="fn">QuickEval.for_llm_judge</span>(<span class="st">"results/"</span>, model=<span class="st">"claude-sonnet-4-6"</span>)

<span class="de">@eval.qa</span>
<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">my_agent</span>(question: str, ground_truth: str = <span class="st">""</span>) -> str:
    <span class="kw">return</span> llm.<span class="fn">invoke</span>(question)</pre>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" id="conversation">
  <div class="sec-title">✨ ConversationSession <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:400;color:var(--text2);margin-left:8px">v0.6.3+</span></div>
  <div class="sec-sub">멀티턴 대화형 에이전트의 품질을 측정합니다. 외부 LLM 없이 순수 Python(Jaccard·top-N 토큰·한국어 조사 정규화)으로 동작합니다.</div>
  <div class="cls-card">
    <div class="cls-head"><span class="cls-name">ConversationSession</span><span class="kind cls">class</span><span class="cls-src">core/trackers/conversation.py</span></div>
    <div class="cls-body">
      <table class="mtable"><thead><tr><th>메서드</th><th>파라미터</th><th>설명</th></tr></thead><tbody>
        <tr><td><span class="p">__init__(session_id)</span></td><td><span class="t">str</span></td><td>세션 초기화</td></tr>
        <tr><td><span class="p">add_turn(user_input, agent_response, metadata=None)</span></td><td><span class="t">str, str, dict|None</span></td><td>대화 턴 추가</td></tr>
        <tr><td><span class="p">compute_metrics()</span></td><td>—</td><td><code>ConversationMetrics</code> 반환. 2턴 미만 시 <code>InvalidOperationError</code></td></tr>
        <tr><td><span class="p">turns</span> (property)</td><td>—</td><td>전체 턴 목록 (읽기 전용)</td></tr>
      </tbody></table>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="cls-card" style="margin-top:12px">
    <div class="cls-head"><span class="cls-name">ConversationMetrics</span><span class="kind cls">dataclass</span></div>
    <div class="cls-body">
      <table class="mtable"><thead><tr><th>필드</th><th>범위</th><th>설명</th></tr></thead><tbody>
        <tr><td><span class="p">context_retention_score</span></td><td><span class="r">0–1</span></td><td>맥락 유지율 — 이전 발화 정보 보존도</td></tr>
        <tr><td><span class="p">topic_coherence_score</span></td><td><span class="r">0–1</span></td><td>주제 일관성 — 대화 주제 유지 정도</td></tr>
        <tr><td><span class="p">progressive_depth_score</span></td><td><span class="r">0–1</span></td><td>점진적 심화도 — 대화 깊이 증가 추세</td></tr>
        <tr><td><span class="p">session_completion_score</span></td><td><span class="r">0–1</span></td><td>세션 완결성 — 마지막 응답 길이 / 평균 응답 길이 (구조적 지표, 대화 품질 직결 아님)</td></tr>
        <tr><td><span class="p">overall_score</span></td><td><span class="r">0–1</span></td><td>4차원 가중 평균</td></tr>
        <tr><td><span class="p">turn_count</span></td><td><span class="r">int</span></td><td>총 턴 수 (= len(turns))</td></tr>
        <tr><td><span class="p">avg_turn_latency</span></td><td><span class="r">float|None</span></td><td>턴별 평균 지연시간 (초). metadata에 latency 키 없으면 None.</td></tr>
      </tbody></table>
<pre><span class="cm"># 권장: @conversation_eval 데코레이터 — 세션 자동 관리</span>
<span class="kw">from</span> <span class="cn">agent_evaluator.decorators</span> <span class="kw">import</span> conversation_eval

<span class="de">@conversation_eval</span>(monitor, flush_every=<span class="nm">5</span>)
<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">chat_agent</span>(user_input: str, session_id: str = <span class="st">""</span>) -> str:
    <span class="kw">return</span> llm.<span class="fn">invoke</span>(user_input)

<span class="cm"># 동일 session_id 호출 → 자동 턴 누산 → 세션 종료 시 ConversationMetrics 기록</span>
chat_agent(<span class="st">"파이썬 비동기 방법은?"</span>, session_id=<span class="st">"conv_001"</span>)
chat_agent(<span class="st">"asyncio.gather 예시 보여줘."</span>, session_id=<span class="st">"conv_001"</span>)
chat_agent(<span class="st">"asyncio.wait와 차이점은?"</span>, session_id=<span class="st">"conv_001"</span>)

<span class="cm"># 또는 PerformanceMonitor.conversation() 컨텍스트 매니저</span>
<span class="kw">with</span> monitor.<span class="fn">conversation</span>(<span class="st">"conv_001"</span>) <span class="kw">as</span> conv:
    conv.<span class="fn">turn</span>(user=<span class="st">"파이썬 비동기 방법은?"</span>, agent=<span class="st">"asyncio를 사용합니다..."</span>)
    conv.<span class="fn">turn</span>(user=<span class="st">"gather 예시 보여줘."</span>, agent=<span class="st">"import asyncio..."</span>)
<span class="cm"># → context_retention, topic_coherence, progressive_depth 자동 집계</span></pre>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" id="gate-cli">
  <div class="sec-title">✨ agent-eval gate <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:400;color:var(--text2);margin-left:8px">CLI · v0.6.3+</span></div>
  <div class="sec-sub">평가 결과 파일을 읽어 품질 임계값 기준으로 합격/실패를 판정합니다. CI/CD 파이프라인에서 릴리스 게이팅에 사용합니다.</div>
  <div class="cls-card">
