        <tr><td><span class="p">--tcr N</span></td><td>Task Completion Rate 최솟값 (%)</td><td rowspan="5"><code>0</code> 통과<br><code>1</code> 기준 미달<br><code>2</code> 회귀 감지</td></tr>
