<!-- ── AnomalyDetector ── -->
<section class="sec" id="anomaly">
  <div class="sec-title">📡 AnomalyDetector</div>
  <div class="sec-sub">Z-score·IQR·선형회귀·비율 알고리즘으로 평가 지표의 이상 패턴을 탐지합니다. <code>PerformanceMonitor(enable_anomaly_detection=True)</code>로 save_to_file() 시 자동 실행.</div>
  <div class="cls-card">
    <div class="cls-head"><span class="cls-name">AnomalyDetector</span><span class="kind cls">class</span><span class="cls-src">agent_evaluator.anomaly.detector</span></div>
    <div class="cls-body">
      {% call param_table() %}
          <tr><td><span class="p">baseline_window</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">int</span></td><td><code>100</code></td><td>기준선 계산에 사용할 최대 태스크 수</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">detection_window</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">int</span></td><td><code>20</code></td><td>현재 상태 비교에 사용할 최근 태스크 수</td></tr>
      {% endcall %}
      <table class="mtable" style="margin-top:12px">
        <thead><tr><th>메서드</th><th>반환</th><th>설명</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><span class="p">scan(monitor)</span></td><td><span class="r">List[AnomalyEvent]</span></td><td>PerformanceMonitor에서 지표를 읽어 이상 탐지 후 AnomalyEvent 목록 반환</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <div class="slbl">AnomalyEvent 필드</div>
      <div class="ret-box">
        <span class="rk">type</span><span class="rv">: str — "accuracy_drift" | "token_spike" | "error_surge" | "security_pattern"</span><br>
        <span class="rk">severity</span><span class="rv">: str — "critical" | "warning"</span><br>
        <span class="rk">detail</span><span class="rv">: str — 상세 설명 (e.g. "정확도 기준선 대비 -96.4% 이탈 (z-score=4.57)")</span><br>
        <span class="rk">value</span><span class="rv">: float — 현재 측정값</span><br>
        <span class="rk">threshold</span><span class="rv">: float — 기준 임계값</span><br>
        <span class="rk">algorithm</span><span class="rv">: str — "z-score" | "iqr" | "linear_regression" | "ratio" | "frequency"</span><br>
        <span class="rk">detected_at</span><span class="rv">: str — ISO-8601 탐지 시각</span>
      </div>
<pre style="margin-top:12px"><span class="kw">from</span> <span class="cn">agent_evaluator</span> <span class="kw">import</span> PerformanceMonitor

<span class="cm"># 방법 1: PerformanceMonitor 내장 — save_to_file() 시 자동 탐지</span>
monitor = <span class="fn">PerformanceMonitor</span>(
    output_dir=<span class="st">"results/"</span>,
    enable_anomaly_detection=<span class="kw">True</span>,
    anomaly_baseline_window=<span class="nm">100</span>,
    anomaly_detection_window=<span class="nm">20</span>,
)
monitor.<span class="fn">record_task</span>(task)
monitor.<span class="fn">save_to_file</span>(<span class="st">"run"</span>)  <span class="cm"># → JSON에 anomaly_data 자동 포함</span>

<span class="cm"># 방법 2: 독립 사용</span>
<span class="kw">from</span> <span class="cn">agent_evaluator.anomaly.detector</span> <span class="kw">import</span> AnomalyDetector
detector = <span class="fn">AnomalyDetector</span>(baseline_window=<span class="nm">50</span>, detection_window=<span class="nm">10</span>)
anomalies = detector.<span class="fn">scan</span>(monitor)
<span class="kw">for</span> a <span class="kw">in</span> anomalies:
    <span class="fn">print</span>(f<span class="st">"{a.type} [{a.severity}] {a.detail} (algo={a.algorithm})"</span>)</pre>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── AlertEngine ── -->
<section class="sec" id="alerts">
  <div class="sec-title">🔔 AlertEngine / SimpleTaskAlertRule</div>
  <div class="sec-sub">지표 임계값 초과 시 실시간 알림을 발송합니다. <code>AlertEngine</code>은 <code>StreamingEvaluator</code>와 연결하는 스트리밍 방식, <code>SimpleTaskAlertRule</code>은 <code>@agent_eval</code> 데코레이터에 직접 연결하는 경량 방식입니다.</div>
  <div class="cls-card">
    <div class="cls-head"><span class="cls-name">AlertRule</span><span class="kind cls">dataclass</span><span class="cls-src">agent_evaluator.alerts.engine</span></div>
    <div class="cls-body">
      {% call field_table(col3='설명') %}
          <tr><td><span class="p">name</span></td><td><span class="t">str</span></td><td>규칙 이름</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">metric</span></td><td><span class="t">str</span></td><td>감시 지표 키 (e.g. <code>"tcr"</code>, <code>"error_rate"</code>, <code>"avg_latency"</code>)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">operator</span></td><td><span class="t">str</span></td><td><code>"lt"</code> | <code>"gt"</code> | <code>"lte"</code> | <code>"gte"</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">threshold</span></td><td><span class="t">float</span></td><td>임계값</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">severity</span></td><td><span class="t">str</span></td><td><code>"critical"</code> | <code>"warning"</code> | <code>"info"</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">cooldown_seconds</span></td><td><span class="t">int</span></td><td>동일 규칙 재발화 최소 간격 (초). 기본 300.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">window</span></td><td><span class="t">str</span></td><td><code>"1m"</code> | <code>"5m"</code> | <code>"1h"</code>. 기본 <code>"5m"</code>.</td></tr>
      {% endcall %}
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="cls-card" style="margin-top:12px">
    <div class="cls-head"><span class="cls-name">AlertEngine</span><span class="kind cls">class</span><span class="cls-src">agent_evaluator.alerts.engine</span></div>
    <div class="cls-body">
      <table class="mtable">
        <thead><tr><th>메서드</th><th>반환</th><th>설명</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><span class="p">add_rule(rule)</span></td><td><span class="r">AlertEngine</span></td><td>AlertRule 추가. 메서드 체이닝 가능.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">evaluate(evaluator)</span></td><td><span class="r">List[AlertEvent]</span></td><td>StreamingEvaluator 지표를 읽어 규칙 평가 후 발화된 알림 반환</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">get_rules()</span></td><td><span class="r">List[Dict]</span></td><td>등록된 규칙 목록</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
<pre style="margin-top:10px"><span class="kw">from</span> <span class="cn">agent_evaluator.alerts.engine</span> <span class="kw">import</span> AlertEngine, AlertRule
<span class="kw">from</span> <span class="cn">agent_evaluator.streaming.evaluator</span> <span class="kw">import</span> StreamingEvaluator
<span class="kw">from</span> <span class="cn">agent_evaluator</span> <span class="kw">import</span> PerformanceMonitor

monitor = <span class="fn">PerformanceMonitor</span>()
engine = <span class="fn">AlertEngine</span>()
engine.<span class="fn">add_rule</span>(<span class="fn">AlertRule</span>(
    name=<span class="st">"TCR 저하"</span>, metric=<span class="st">"tcr"</span>, operator=<span class="st">"lt"</span>,
    threshold=<span class="nm">0.7</span>, severity=<span class="st">"critical"</span>, cooldown_seconds=<span class="nm">300</span>
))
streamer = <span class="fn">StreamingEvaluator</span>(monitor=monitor, alert_handler=engine)
streamer.<span class="fn">start</span>()
streamer.<span class="fn">record</span>(<span class="st">"t1"</span>, success=<span class="kw">True</span>, execution_time=<span class="nm">1.2</span>, tokens_used=<span class="nm">300</span>)</pre>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="cls-card" style="margin-top:12px">
    <div class="cls-head"><span class="cls-name">SimpleTaskAlertRule</span><span class="kind cls">class</span><span class="cls-src">agent_evaluator.alerts.engine</span></div>
    <div class="cls-desc"><code>StreamingEvaluator</code> 불필요. <code>@agent_eval</code>, <code>@batch_eval</code>, <code>EvalDecorator</code>에 <code>alert_rules=[rule]</code> 파라미터로 직접 연결하는 경량 알림 규칙.</div>
    <div class="cls-body">
      {% call param_table() %}
          <tr><td><span class="p">name</span><span class="req">✦</span></td><td><span class="t">str</span></td><td>—</td><td>규칙 이름</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">condition</span><span class="req">✦</span></td><td><span class="t">Callable[[TaskResult], bool]</span></td><td>—</td><td>알림 발동 조건</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">handler</span><span class="req">✦</span></td><td><span class="t">Callable[[str, TaskResult], None]</span></td><td>—</td><td>알림 핸들러 (메시지, TaskResult)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">severity</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">str</span></td><td><code>"warning"</code></td><td><code>"critical"</code> | <code>"warning"</code> | <code>"info"</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">cooldown</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">int</span></td><td><code>0</code></td><td>재발화 최소 간격 (초)</td></tr>
      {% endcall %}
<pre style="margin-top:10px"><span class="kw">from</span> <span class="cn">agent_evaluator</span> <span class="kw">import</span> SimpleTaskAlertRule
<span class="kw">from</span> <span class="cn">agent_evaluator.decorators</span> <span class="kw">import</span> agent_eval

rule = <span class="fn">SimpleTaskAlertRule</span>(
    name=<span class="st">"slow_response"</span>,
    condition=<span class="kw">lambda</span> tr: tr.execution_time > <span class="nm">5.0</span>,
    handler=<span class="kw">lambda</span> msg, tr: <span class="fn">print</span>(f<span class="st">"[ALERT] {msg}"</span>),
    severity=<span class="st">"warning"</span>, cooldown=<span class="nm">60</span>,
)

<span class="de">@agent_eval</span>(monitor, task_type=<span class="st">"qa"</span>, alert_rules=[rule])
<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">my_agent</span>(question: str, ground_truth: str = <span class="st">""</span>) -> str: ...</pre>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── StreamingEvaluator ── -->
<section class="sec" id="streaming">
  <div class="sec-title">🌊 StreamingEvaluator</div>
  <div class="sec-sub">슬라이딩 윈도우(1m·5m·1h) 기반 실시간 평가. 배치 저장 없이 최근 지표를 즉시 산출합니다.</div>
  <div class="cls-card">
    <div class="cls-head"><span class="cls-name">StreamingEvaluator</span><span class="kind cls">class</span><span class="cls-src">agent_evaluator.streaming.evaluator</span></div>
    <div class="cls-body">
      {% call param_table() %}
          <tr><td><span class="p">monitor</span><span class="req">✦</span></td><td><span class="t">PerformanceMonitor</span></td><td>—</td><td>연결할 PerformanceMonitor 인스턴스</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">flush_interval</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">int</span></td><td><code>60</code></td><td>백그라운드 flush 간격 (초)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">alert_handler</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">AlertEngine|None</span></td><td><code>None</code></td><td>알림 엔진. 연결 시 record() 호출마다 규칙 자동 평가.</td></tr>
      {% endcall %}
      <table class="mtable" style="margin-top:12px">
        <thead><tr><th>메서드</th><th>반환</th><th>설명</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><span class="p">record(task_id, success, execution_time, tokens_used=0, accuracy_score=0.0, has_error=False)</span></td><td><span class="r">None</span></td><td>태스크 결과를 슬라이딩 윈도우에 기록. alert_handler 연결 시 규칙 자동 평가.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">get_stats(window="5m")</span></td><td><span class="r">Dict</span></td><td>윈도우 통계 반환. 키: <code>count</code>, <code>tcr</code>, <code>avg_latency</code>, <code>p95_latency</code>, <code>error_rate</code>, <code>avg_tokens</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">start()</span></td><td><span class="r">None</span></td><td>백그라운드 flush 스레드 시작</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">stop()</span></td><td><span class="r">None</span></td><td>백그라운드 flush 스레드 중지</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <div class="note" style="margin-top:8px">📊 <code>window</code>: <code>"1m"</code>(60초) · <code>"5m"</code>(300초) · <code>"1h"</code>(3600초) 세 가지 윈도우를 동시 관리합니다.</div>
<pre style="margin-top:10px"><span class="kw">from</span> <span class="cn">agent_evaluator</span> <span class="kw">import</span> PerformanceMonitor
<span class="kw">from</span> <span class="cn">agent_evaluator.streaming.evaluator</span> <span class="kw">import</span> StreamingEvaluator

monitor = <span class="fn">PerformanceMonitor</span>()
streamer = <span class="fn">StreamingEvaluator</span>(monitor=monitor, flush_interval=<span class="nm">60</span>)
streamer.<span class="fn">start</span>()

<span class="cm"># 태스크 결과 실시간 기록</span>
streamer.<span class="fn">record</span>(<span class="st">"t1"</span>, success=<span class="kw">True</span>, execution_time=<span class="nm">1.2</span>, tokens_used=<span class="nm">350</span>, accuracy_score=<span class="nm">0.9</span>)

<span class="cm"># 슬라이딩 윈도우 통계 조회</span>
stats = streamer.<span class="fn">get_stats</span>(<span class="st">"5m"</span>)
<span class="cm"># → {'count': 12, 'tcr': 0.92, 'avg_latency': 1.1, 'p95_latency': 2.3, 'error_rate': 0.08}</span>
streamer.<span class="fn">stop</span>()</pre>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── CostTracker / AdaptivePolicy ── -->
<section class="sec" id="cost">
  <div class="sec-title">💸 CostTracker / AdaptivePolicy</div>
  <div class="sec-sub">외부 평가 API 호출 비용을 추적하고 예산 초과 시 샘플링률을 자동 조정합니다.</div>
  <div class="cls-card">
    <div class="cls-head"><span class="cls-name">CostTracker</span><span class="kind cls">class</span><span class="cls-src">agent_evaluator.cost.policy</span></div>
    <div class="cls-body">
      {% call param_table() %}
          <tr><td><span class="p">budget_per_day</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">float|None</span></td><td><code>None</code></td><td>일일 예산 한도 (USD). None이면 한도 없음.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">alert_at</span><span class="opt">opt</span></td><td><span class="t">float</span></td><td><code>0.8</code></td><td>예산 경고 비율 (0.0–1.0). 기본 80% 도달 시 경고.</td></tr>
