      <table class="mtable" style="font-size:12px">
        <thead><tr><th>파라미터명</th><th>Config 클래스</th><th>핵심 필드</th><th>기본 판정 기준</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><code>instructions</code></td><td><span class="t">InstructionConfig</span></td><td><code>expected_format</code>, <code>required_keywords</code>, <code>min_chars</code></td><td>키워드 미포함 → FAIL</td></tr>
