    <div class="cls-body">
      <div class="cls-desc">평가 결과에서 골든 데이터셋을 자동 추출하고 Phoenix로 업로드합니다. <code>merge_to_golden()</code> + <code>upload_to_phoenix()</code>를 한 번에 처리하는 편의 메서드입니다.</div>
      <table class="mtable" style="margin-top:8px">
        <thead><tr><th>메서드</th><th>반환</th><th>설명</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><span class="p">push_to_phoenix(cases, dataset_name, phoenix_endpoint="http://localhost:6006", version="latest")</span></td><td><span class="r">Optional[str]</span></td><td>골든셋을 저장 후 Phoenix Datasets API에 업로드. 반환값: <code>dataset_id</code> (실패 시 <code>None</code>)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">extract(strategies=["failure_cases","high_value"], ...)</span></td><td><span class="r">List[Dict]</span></td><td>평가 결과에서 골든셋 후보 추출. <code>strategies</code>: <code>"failure_cases"</code> | <code>"high_value"</code> | <code>"diverse"</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="p">merge_to_golden(cases, version="latest", output_name=None)</span></td><td><span class="r">Path</span></td><td>케이스를 골든셋 JSON에 병합 저장. 중복 제거.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
<pre style="margin-top:10px"><span class="kw">from</span> <span class="cn">agent_evaluator.datasets.builder</span> <span class="kw">import</span> GoldenSetBuilder

builder = <span class="fn">GoldenSetBuilder</span>(<span class="st">"results/"</span>, <span class="st">"data/golden_datasets/"</span>)
candidates = builder.<span class="fn">extract</span>(strategies=[<span class="st">"failure_cases"</span>, <span class="st">"high_value"</span>])
dataset_id = builder.<span class="fn">push_to_phoenix</span>(
    candidates,
    dataset_name=<span class="st">"qa-golden-v1"</span>,
    phoenix_endpoint=<span class="st">"http://localhost:6006"</span>,  <span class="cm"># phoenix_url= 아님 주의</span>
)
<span class="cm"># Phoenix UI → Datasets &amp; Experiments 탭에서 확인</span></pre>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

